<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates widen in very short market.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates widen in very short market.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight rates widened on Monday to between 10-1/8 and 10-1/4 percent from Sunday's 10-1/8 and 10-3/16 percent in a very short private market, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates narrowed to 10-1/16 and 10-3/8 percent from 10-1/4 and 10-3/8 percent on Sunday.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
